pu: (pulley: def"
A mass-centric article that creates angular momentum and can multiply force.
Used from belt driven devices to linear applications like cranes.)
(dimensions: radius, width, depth, material;)

cbp: (Combine Pulley: def"
A mass-centric article that uses two pulleys that spin the same rpm with different circumferences.;)
(input: mv, rpm;)(output: mv, rpm;)
(dimensions: (master: radius, width, depth, material;)(slave: radius, width, depth, material;))

pus: (Pulley System: def"
A mass-centric device that creates angular momentum and can multiply force.
Used from belt driven devices to linear applications like cranes.)
(input: mv, rpm;)(output: mv, rpm;)
(dimensions: (master: radius, width, depth, material;)(slave: radius, width, depth, material;))

gr: (Gear: def"
A mass-centric article that creates angular momentum.)
(dimensions: radius, width, tooth count, tooth depth, material;)

cgr: (Combine Gear: def"
A mass-centric article that combines 2 gears that share rpm with different circumferences.)
(dimensions: (master: radius, width, tooth count, tooth depth, material;)(slave: radius, width, depth, tooth count, tooth depth, material;))

gt: (Gear Train: def"
A combination of gears aligned to spin one another from a driven point.;)
(input: mv, rpm;)(output: mv, rpm;)
(dimensions: (master: radius, width, tooth count, tooth depth, material;)(slave: radius, width, depth, tooth count, tooth depth, material;))